祝","title":"少司缘-拾年声藏贺文","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"缘分这东西呀，捉摸不定。\n像司缘堂的红线，千丝万缕。\n能在此刻与你相遇，共度一段时光。\n于我而言，便是值得珍惜的良缘。\n往后呀~\n愿我的红线能为你牵来更多温暖和真情。\n而我也会一直陪伴着你~","hasText":true,"duration":24.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/06561692952A21000183535373932323233.mp3"},{"id":"0691566B49D301000183136343239313331","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到东皇太一","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘（自我感叹）：瞧我新出炉的虐心佳作，师徒决裂，挚友分离……定能感动整个森林！","hasText":true,"duration":9.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0691566B49D301000183136343239313331.mp3"},{"id":"0626466B49D2F1000183433303330353539","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到敖隐2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：（耸肩）（嗯哼~）今日拌嘴大赛，小鹿两分，小龙一分~","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0626466B49D2F1000183433303330353539.mp3"},{"id":"0608666B49D2F1000183738353638333239","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到鬼谷子1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：哪怕故人还能重逢，也当认不出我了吧？","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0608666B49D2F1000183738353638333239.mp3"},{"id":"0661166B49D301000183136393931353737","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到鬼谷子2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：我见过的判词里有这样一个人：众叛亲离成神，却是孤家寡人（小红：孤呱）","hasText":true,"duration":8.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0661166B49D301000183136393931353737.mp3"},{"id":"0634066B49D2E1000183336363237393638","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到云中君-敌","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘（话剧式夸张表演）：（呵）云中君露出凶恶的真面目，我要告诉善良的小鹿，千万不要被他骗住","hasText":true,"duration":7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0634066B49D2E1000183336363237393638.mp3"},{"id":"0678166B49D2E1000183732393738353334","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到瑶3","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：小小司命，不在话下（击掌 耶）","hasText":true,"duration":3.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0678166B49D2E1000183732393738353334.mp3"},{"id":"0661166B49D2F1000183733343238303135","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到敖隐1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘（逗小孩）：想进忘忧沼泽吗~说句好听的，姐姐教你绕开 那个家伙~","hasText":true,"duration":6.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0661166B49D2F1000183733343238303135.mp3"},{"id":"0661166B49D2E1000183134393536333334","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到瑶2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"小缘：它偶尔也是正的~比如小鹿，最聪明的最厉害","hasText":true,"duration":4.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0661166B49D2E1000183134393536333334.mp3"},{"id":"0644166B49D2D1000183137303330343333","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到瑶1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘（逗弄）：是~你真的没有在想某个天上的神君～他也真的没有鸟一样的爪子和云一样的头发～","hasText":true,"duration":8.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0644166B49D2D1000183137303330343333.mp3"},{"id":"0665066B49D2F1000183137383533343630","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到云中君-友","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘（品评）：发型、轮廓、羽毛的颜色……（不情愿）行吧，勉强及格。但阿瑶可是样样满分诶！","hasText":true,"duration":10.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0665066B49D2F1000183137383533343630.mp3"},{"id":"0680066B49D2D1000183131373937363032","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到大司命4","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：东边日出西边雨，道是无情却有情~神巫大人，听听你这判词如何？","hasText":true,"duration":11.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0680066B49D2D1000183131373937363032.mp3"},{"id":"0695166B49D2D1000183137303634323935","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到大司命3","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：都说离去的人会在忘忧沼泽重逢，你真的不曾见过我的故人？","hasText":true,"duration":7.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0695166B49D2D1000183137303634323935.mp3"},{"id":"0699066B49D2D1000183136333631323130","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到大司命5","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：啊？什么特训？司缘堂业务繁忙，下次再见喽~（距离拉远）","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0699066B49D2D1000183136333631323130.mp3"},{"id":"0686866B49D2C1000183137323332323336","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"败方MVP","category":"MVP","seq":null,"text":"随缘就好~过程既已享受，结果不必强求~（小蓝：随缘嘛。）","hasText":true,"duration":6.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0686866B49D2C1000183137323332323336.mp3"},{"id":"0612466B49D2C1000183136323737323836","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到大司命1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘（假装震惊伤心）：你我之间何来擅闯？神巫大人~~这叫主动汇报工作~","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0612466B49D2C1000183136323737323836.mp3"},{"id":"0663066B49D2C1000183833383932363938","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"遇到大司命2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：（嗯~）多谢夸奖~","hasText":true,"duration":2.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0663066B49D2C1000183833383932363938.mp3"},{"id":"0683466B49D2B1000183132313430323533","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"胜方MVP","category":"MVP","seq":null,"text":"习惯就好~司缘堂向来业绩第一（小红：习惯啦！）","hasText":true,"duration":5.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0683466B49D2B1000183132313430323533.mp3"},{"id":"0601166B49D2B1000183237303331333737","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"购买装备-霸者重装","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"距离继承少司命大人的力量，又近了一步","hasText":true,"duration":3.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0601166B49D2B1000183237303331333737.mp3"},{"id":"0656466B49D2A1000183135393537393436","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"购买装备-时之预言","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"“天生孤星，灾祸横行”——这便是我曾被预言的命运","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0656466B49D2A1000183135393537393436.mp3"},{"id":"0694466B49D2B1000183137393937383837","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"购买装备-不祥征兆","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"何谓不祥？何为命运？有人让我知晓，从无预言天定，只有珍惜相遇。","hasText":true,"duration":8.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0694466B49D2B1000183137393937383837.mp3"},{"id":"0604466B49D2A1000183630303139353032","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"购买装备-破茧之衣","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"孤独是只越缠越紧的茧，但别担心，总有人相信你是蝴蝶","hasText":true,"duration":7.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0604466B49D2A1000183630303139353032.mp3"},{"id":"0610166B49D2A1000183133363631313239","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"购买装备-秘法之靴","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"问我来巫神祝前打过多少份工……嘘，是秘密哦~","hasText":true,"duration":6.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0610166B49D2A1000183133363631313239.mp3"},{"id":"0651366B49D291000183232343435303935","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"路过野怪-蓝buff","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"小蓝，就算你长大后是这个模样，我也能认出你\n小蓝：（无奈）哦。","hasText":true,"duration":6.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0651366B49D291000183232343435303935.mp3"},{"id":"0631566B49D291000183135383332393732","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"路过野怪-红Buff","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"同样是小红，你可比我家的那只安静多了（小红：喂！）","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0631566B49D291000183135383332393732.mp3"},{"id":"0606566B49D291000183131363037353131","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"路过大龙","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"你曾与谁约定过，要守护此地吗？……我也是。","hasText":true,"duration":5.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0606566B49D291000183131363037353131.mp3"},{"id":"0660466B49D281000183133303032353031","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"休闲待机2","category":"待机","seq":null,"text":"要我再讲一遍从枯灾中救出你们的故事啊？真是听不腻~","hasText":true,"duration":7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0660466B49D281000183133303032353031.mp3"},{"id":"0644166B49D291000183337383839333239","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"购买装备-近卫·救赎","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"这并不难。如果你曾淋过雨，便知道如何撑起一把伞","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0644166B49D291000183337383839333239.mp3"},{"id":"0629666B49D281000183132373631303231","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"休闲待机1","category":"待机","seq":null,"text":"我本孤身，也曾有亲人，后来……（停顿然后释怀笑）就遇到你们啦","hasText":true,"duration":7.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0629666B49D281000183132373631303231.mp3"},{"id":"0627266B49D271000183730393237313638","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"出生语音1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"在找司缘堂？朝着忘忧沼泽的反方向走——它就在森林最热闹的地方","hasText":true,"duration":7.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0627266B49D271000183730393237313638.mp3"},{"id":"0678866B49D271000183539323937303136","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"出生语音2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：我们的口号是~\n小红（激动）：没有困难的事务！\n小蓝（叹气）：只有不够忙碌的巫祝。","hasText":true,"duration":8.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0678866B49D271000183539323937303136.mp3"},{"id":"0631466B49D281000183736393437383830","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"低血量回城","category":"回城","seq":null,"text":"少司缘：突击考核？……快快快回去准备！\n小蓝：大人，注意人设。\n少司缘：咳咳","hasText":true,"duration":8.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0631466B49D281000183736393437383830.mp3"},{"id":"0694766B49D1F1000183132313730383731","heroId":"1276","skinId":"1277","skinName":"聆愿之祝","title":"移动语音11","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"故人兮永离，相逢兮无期；梦回兮年少，梦醒兮杳杳……","hasText":true,"duration":12.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1276/0694766B49D1F100018313